{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Standby Fans 專為 iPhone 及 iPad 的 StandBy 模式設計，讓用戶能將裝置轉化為個性化桌面顯示器。此應用提供多種精美小部件樣式，適合希望優化待機畫面、提升桌面美感的用戶。目前 App Store 限時免費下載，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n\n<h2>多樣化待機小部件</h2>\n<p>內置數十款風格各異的小部件，涵蓋翻頁鐘、數碼顯示及復古款式。支持實時天氣資訊與氛圍動畫，如營火或黑膠唱片旋轉效果。所有部件均可自定義字體、顏色與大小，並完美適配 iPad 螢幕，讓你的夜間床頭櫃或書桌瞬間變成專屬智能顯示屏。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-144-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-145-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-146-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-147-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-148-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Standby Fans – Display Clock</li>\n<li>應用類別：Graphics &amp; Design</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T05:22:17.846009+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}